-- title: Object storage API unreachable
-- description: The S3 API did not answer with 403 for 3 minutes. Customers cannot upload or download files.
-- severity: High
-- url: https://s3-svc.{wildcard_domain}/beacon-probe/
-- region: all
-- expected_status: 403
-- timeout: 10
-- pending_for: 180
-- resolve_after: 300
-- runbook_url: https://github.com/frappe/cargo/blob/develop/beacon/runbooks/object-storage-api-unreachable.md
-- Beacon sends an unsigned S3 request through the gateway each minute, and Garage refuses it with 403. A 403 shows that the S3 API answers.
-- Garage counts the request, so the Object Storage service has valid events when customers send no requests.
